    {
      "name": "list_mods",
      "description": "[只读] 获取模组列表核心数据(all_mods)。扫描完成或状态变更后调用此方法刷新。\n（MCP 扩展）filter 按 name+packageId 子串匹配(大小写不敏感)；fields 投影字段；\nlimit/offset 分页(信封返回 total/items/next_offset)。不传 limit 时返回全量并由\n体积护栏按元素边界截断(hint 引导继续用 limit/offset/filter)。\n加载顺序用 get_load_order，分组用 get_groups。",
      "inputSchema": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "filter": {
            "default": "",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "fields": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "type": "array"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "default": null
          },
          "limit": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "default": null
          },
          "offset": {
            "default": 0,
            "type": "integer"
          }
        },
        "type": "object"
      },
      "annotations": {
        "readOnlyHint": true,
        "destructiveHint": false
      }
    },
