    {
      "name": "apply_load_order_ops",
      "description": "[写] 以增量操作原子地修改加载顺序（推荐的顺序变更入口）。\nops 逐条执行、整体全有全无：{\"op\":\"insert\",\"id\":X,\"anchor\":{after|before|index}}、\n{\"op\":\"remove\",\"ids\":[...]}, {\"op\":\"move\",\"id\":X,\"to\":{index|after|before}},、\n{\"op\":\"activate\",\"ids\":[...]}, {\"op\":\"deactivate\",\"ids\":[...]}（上限 100 条）。\nbase_version_token 来自 get_load_order 响应；dry_run:true 只校验不落盘。\n落盘成功(dry_run=false)的响应含 summary/conflicts/new_version_token，绝不回传全量列表；\ndry_run 的响应只有 summary/conflicts，不含 new_version_token(只有真正写盘才发新 token)。",
      "inputSchema": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "base_version_token": {
            "additionalProperties": true,
            "type": "object"
          },
          "ops": {
            "items": {
              "additionalProperties": true,
              "type": "object"
            },
            "type": "array"
          },
          "dry_run": {
            "default": false,
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "base_version_token",
          "ops"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      "annotations": {
        "readOnlyHint": false,
        "destructiveHint": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "set_mod_rule",
      "description": "[写] 增、改或删一条本模组的用户排序/冲突规则（AI 助手\"应用模组规则\"动作的同源能力）。\nrelation: loadAfter=本模组必须排在 target_id 之后(target 是前置)、loadBefore=必须排在\ntarget_id 之前、incompatibleWith=两者不应同时启用;remove:true 只删除指定的这一条关系,\n该模组其它既有规则一律保留(合并写入,非整包替换)。comment 为可选备注,显示在规则管理界面。\n内容无变化时返回 action=noop 不落盘;规则即时写盘并影响后续自动排序,建议写前用\nget_mod_rules(package_id) 确认现状。",
      "inputSchema": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "package_id": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "relation": {
            "enum": [
              "loadAfter",
              "loadBefore",
              "incompatibleWith"
            ],
            "type": "string"
          },
          "target_id": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "comment": {
            "default": "",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "remove": {
            "default": false,
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "package_id",
          "relation",
          "target_id"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      "annotations": {
        "readOnlyHint": false,
        "destructiveHint": false
      }
    }
  ]
